    {"keystrokes": "look\n", "duration": 0.3}
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I'm in the Kitchen with the lantern (lit). The lantern was on the trophy case in the Living Room. I still need the brown sack and bottle (both in the Kitchen) and the elvish sword (in the Living Room). Carrying capacity is helped by the brown sack. I'll grab these, then go up the staircase to the Cellar to find the grating into the underground.",
