  "analysis": "Score jumped to 35 (the trap door opened and I descended). The sword is glowing with a blue glow, indicating a troll is nearby (in the north passage). The Cellar connects north (to the Troll Room, blocked by the troll), south (crawlway to the Grate), and west (unclimbable ramp). The trap door is now barred so I can't return the easy way. I should kill the troll for 5 points and safe passage, then proceed south through the grate into the underground.",
  "plan": "Go north to confront the troll and attack it with the elvish sword. Then I'll proceed south through the crawlway to the grate and descend into the underground to begin collecting treasures.",
